graph TB
  A["DETERMINISTIC CHECKS<br/>Was tool X called? Does the schema<br/>validate? Exact match?<br/><br/>Free. Instant. Never flaky.<br/>Run on every commit."]
  B["TRAJECTORY CHECKS<br/>Right tools, right order? How many<br/>steps? What did it cost?<br/><br/>Free. The agent-specific layer<br/>almost nobody builds."]
  C["LLM AS JUDGE<br/>Is the answer relevant, grounded,<br/>complete?<br/><br/>Costs money. Needs calibration<br/>against human labels or it lies."]
  D["HUMAN REVIEW<br/>The ground truth everything else<br/>is calibrated against.<br/><br/>Expensive. Small samples.<br/>Irreplaceable."]

  A --> B --> C --> D

  N["Push work DOWN this ladder.<br/>Every check you can make<br/>deterministic is one you never<br/>have to calibrate, pay for,<br/>or argue about."]

  D -.- N

  classDef free fill:#E8F4F0,stroke:#0E7C7B
  classDef paid fill:#FDF3E0,stroke:#B26A00
  classDef dear fill:#FBE9E9,stroke:#9B2C2C
  classDef note fill:#F4F6F8,stroke:#1F4E79,color:#5A5A5A
  class A,B free
  class C paid
  class D dear
  class N note
